{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309780","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309780","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130978001:1":{"text":"전혀. 석양의 신 보물이니 뭐니… 난 하나도 관심 없다고.","source_cn":"不想。什么残阳神的宝藏……我是一点兴趣也没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF820D0197592202B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130978002:1":{"text":"어릴 때부터 고원에서 자랐지만 보물에 대한 얘기는 한 번도 들어본 적 없어! 왜 인제 와서 그것도 외지인의 말을 믿는 건지 이해가 안 되고.","source_cn":"大家都是从小长在高原上，压根没听说过有什么宝藏啊！不明...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11DF8D96FD6FCC06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130978003:1":{"text":"게다가 사실대로 말하면 흥을 깬다고 욕까지 해대니… 참, 이게 다 무슨 일이람…","source_cn":"而且我说两句实话还得被骂，说我扫了他们的兴。这都什么事啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B3DBB6CDE03F6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130978004:1":{"text":"난 그냥 여기 얌전히 있을래. 그들이 정말 보물을 찾았다고 해도 전혀 부럽지 않아.","source_cn":"我还是老老实实躲在这吧。就算他们真找到了宝藏，我也不眼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82043D450AB7C34C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血戈雷":{"text":"그레이","source":"蛮血戈雷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}